# Keys.
# app/debug.keystore is INTENTIONALLY TRACKED: it is the well-known public Android
# debug key (password "android", shipped in every RN/Expo template), and signing
# with this exact key is what lets the new APK install over the old Expo app
# (v1.0.9). A future production keystore must NEVER be committed:
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
